        "original_id": "e0702e3c-5863-5433-b335-bf8e6af357a2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: \"Quando me'n vo'\", \"Musetta's Waltz\", \"La bohème\", \"Scènes de la vie de bohème\"\n- People: Giacomo Puccini, Luigi Illica, Giuseppe Giacosa, Henri Murger\n- Concepts: soprano aria, waltz, 3/4 time, opera, Italian libretto, Act 2, four acts\n\nFacts:\n- \"La bohème\" is an opera in four acts composed by Giacomo Puccini.\n- \"La bohème\" has an Italian libretto by Luigi Illica and Giuseppe Giacosa.\n- \"La bohème\" is based on Henri Murger's \"Scènes de la vie de bohème\".\n- \"Quando me'n vo'\", also known as \"Musetta's Waltz\", is a soprano aria from Act 2 of \"La bohème\".\n- \"Quando me'n vo'\" is in 3/4 time, making it a waltz.",
